{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c67afbb008b4ad0df957137d93aadcff7a38a690378129d44014e8a1df643e81", "ja": "想い、抱えて", "zh": "怀抱思念", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bb6205d14e89d8a969918f5b9abbe2253dc86f88f6c459bfac4a9f6f9e0d29ed", "ja": "公演の稽古が始まる。桃子はメンバーにアド\nバイスをしながら、自身も稽古に励む。皆が\n帰った後、ひとり居残り稽古をしている桃子\nの元に、海美がやってくる。海美は「最近、\nお芝居が楽しい」と無邪気に話す。", "zh": "演出的排练开始了。桃子一边给成员们提建议，一边努力进行自己的排练。大家都回去后，海美来到独自留下来排练的桃子身边。海美天真地说：“我最近觉得演戏很开心。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "792de80d9662884b63756e7b53c8f78d5876d636b6c3ebf3727c6e438a601b3f", "ja": "（いよいよ、第一回公演の稽古が始まった。\nそれぞれ仕事もある中、調整しながらのスタートだ）", "zh": "（终于开始第一场公演的排练了。\n大家都有各自的工作，只能一边协调时间一边开始。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d99e3f0a9a4497ecaf853110eb4919d7fd621f5ebfc7b5e08df7e5f8bb2df6d", "ja": "『あなた。アイドルになりなさい』", "zh": "“你，去成为偶像吧。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "e763220152490bf6afe95d0eca21fec8450ec2c6a3a6dab88366e825add48a71", "ja": "風花さん。今のセリフ、\nまだちょっと優しく聞こえるかも。", "zh": "风花姐，你刚才那句台词，\n听起来可能还是有点温柔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "11f2eedd9400967dfab84e3d6533fedabbf7528a33719c1cf826270c64e11304", "ja": "そっか……湿度のない感じって、難しいね。\nどんな感じでお芝居すればいいのか……。", "zh": "这样啊……没有湿度的感觉，还真难演。\n到底该用什么感觉来演才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "26b50208261c780403a4042a5ae999a7367382159b52c98654fd14be2d3c99cf", "ja": "自分の役だけど、このマネージャーさんって、\nちょっと得体が知れない感じがするよね……。", "zh": "虽然是我自己的角色，但这个经理感觉有点让人摸不透呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "7645e693d84c346347cc5fffcdefd8d6e7e15e4d1852722b1f074b03da20d834", "ja": "そうだね……。あ、だったら、\nちょっと突き放すみたいに言ってみるのはどう？", "zh": "是啊……啊，那要不要试着用稍微冷淡地撇开对方的语气说说看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "86774d1e05b3bcdec97ad9ef1035107b49db8f04bbc8c18ceefb34e525e5df10", "ja": "このマネージャーさんって、主人公のことを\nあんまり子どもだと思ってない感じがするから……。", "zh": "感觉这位经纪人似乎并不怎么把主角当成小孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9dc37e3df55a321cbe58fa67f8cb4ef5111b77d2158e51c827c06497d25623e3", "ja": "確かに……。\n突き放す……わかった、やってみるね！", "zh": "确实……。\n放手不管……明白了，我来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "6ce34b2be30b2a4efeb0afff70aefc364659d19d381dcccfd55fa5082ec45014", "ja": "みんなも、わからないことがあったら聞いて。\n桃子が知ってることなら、なんでも教えるから。", "zh": "大家要是有不明白的地方，也可以问我。\n只要是桃子知道的，我什么都可以教给你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "b84b2e112c80ebe0696773011418d5686541cc68db33620e69e4c2f02fee6087", "ja": "はいなのです！\n桃子ちゃん、とっても頼りにしてるのですよ♪", "zh": "好哦！桃子，我可是很指望你的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "b6e27f8fb530261de61bafd3de624cb5b47d1e33f390487c52a8ea8f494fa509", "ja": "もう、まつりさん、からかわないで。\nじゃあ次は、1幕2場。海美さんのセリフからだよ。", "zh": "真是的，茉莉小姐，别开玩笑了啦。\n那接下来是第1幕第2场。从海美小姐的台词开始哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "85d47314db5466379917d79edc5af97ee92650674e244b9146d09467ebbfab41", "ja": "（みんな、熱が入ってるな。特に桃子は\n主演を務めるだけあって、張り切っているみたいだ）", "zh": "（大家都热情高涨啊。尤其是桃子，毕竟是主演，看起来干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c7a44bdb83c481c078e4b11d36796ea9efb10e55bc58633ae782638846408faf", "ja": "（それも、自分の演技だけを磨き上げるんじゃなく、\n周りのみんなと一緒に、更に高みを目指している……）", "zh": "而且，她并不是只磨炼自己的演技，还在和周围的大家一起，向更高的目标迈进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "0daa9a14de9b8606dae58b8fa643f0d01d01c52c9e4afd9a9ddb40925dc04a26", "ja": "……うん。切りもいいし、今日はここまでかな。\nお兄ちゃん、問題ないよね？", "zh": "……嗯。正好也告一段落了，今天就练到这里吧。\n哥哥，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cbf44189407faa9a994f05382a9abcb41ece4b1e16523c5211751ef3f6300276", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nみんな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "嗯，当然。\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "02cb46056492b5e4ed0e5eba05b300bf6b1957d09824db94014450b18879a101", "ja": "ふ～っ、いっぱい稽古したね！\nいい汗かいた～！", "zh": "呼——今天练了好多啊！\n出了一身汗，真痛快～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d2fda602e7af7afbcebbd76594952e0140bde58f8792285e8b425811e69e2186", "ja": "今のところ、順調に進んでるな。\n次に全員がそろうのは……来週か。", "zh": "目前为止，进展得很顺利。\n下次大家能到齐……就是下周了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6c04e0e57a7a1c83167936810ad31018dd42de589b751bf6c02b11e3a2833344", "ja": "はい。私とまつりちゃんは、他のお仕事があって、\nしばらく参加できそうになくて……。", "zh": "是的。我和茉莉还有其他工作，暂时似乎没法参加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "e3434d5b05e097afcb5b0e027236904fea1b36c205d6c75bfa2d428997da5a83", "ja": "心配はいらないのですよ、風花ちゃん♪\n一緒にできなくても、個人練習ならできるのです。", "zh": "不用担心哦，风花♪\n就算没法一起练习，个人练习还是可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "4cfa3a96016b6be3df6a451d1352272f48bc863b16359b97a0c74b86680d8c65", "ja": "ね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "对吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cb8aaa20204df9278959f6e0bad08c896f0d8cf06cae214caaaae2bf4f5f65ee", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。来週、全員そろった時、\n今度は頭から最後まで通してみようと思う。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。下周大家到齐的时候，我想这次从头到尾完整排练一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "12275d6707c19a9120fd2b7ddd678864a21b045528a45f178b164bd8956234f6", "ja": "それまで各自、稽古を進めておいてくれ！", "zh": "在那之前，大家各自继续排练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "好的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "27e92d7bc16a2e8f18836e59506689520be532e10c397e574f8cae396b7c591c", "ja": "あのね、お姉ちゃん。私、お医者さんになりたいの。\n……うーん、なんか違うような……。", "zh": "那个啊，姐姐。我想成为医生。\n……嗯——总觉得好像不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1029_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "da88e428e3c24df2254114b7abaa9837d10b41dbd361b2680f1d5f86635833bb", "ja": "あれっ、ももちん！", "zh": "咦，桃子亲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "9a9091494d4296e350d613bb424b1c59028aef90f68d5be8a69769b2edae15ce", "ja": "海美さん……。\nもしかして、稽古しに来たの？", "zh": "海美姐姐……。  \n难道是来排练的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "30012213150259d5b7dee0d94de33962f5dedb75b1e18c4d2826a6dcc6f5c273", "ja": "うんっ！　もしかして、ももちんも？\nだったら、一緒に稽古しようよ！　いいでしょ！？", "zh": "嗯！难道桃子你也是来练习的吗？\n那就一起练习吧！好不好嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "d2c60429ee3286062a794c3756a2d999fe07fc9ac03b90abd7af2ae354094674", "ja": "う、うん。\nいいけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n倒是可以啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "df5df421b79e471ab460ea87329152f415b1dc6d95040c6dd58e4efa1bc85a79", "ja": "私とももちんってさ、こうやって\nガッツリお芝居で一緒になるの、初めてだよね！", "zh": "我和桃子像这样认真一起演戏，还是第一次吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "837a1be41cc02dd9ca5e797a5b762f7f509bc34d9b8e773dfd9397ad55b17e51", "ja": "だから私、すっごくうれしくて！", "zh": "所以我特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "e1b6b0b90dc64cb1cdc4e1fb3d3e0e30bafd6349e6ea85729d528f26039d66ee", "ja": "うれしい……そうなんだ？", "zh": "开心……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "d524818dbea917a0f457a6e86999a148023e32d79a04b1fb921fee35cb68a1b1", "ja": "うん！　あとね、私最近、お芝居って\n楽しいなーって思うようになってきたんだ！", "zh": "嗯！还有啊，我最近开始觉得，演戏真开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "c541112469eeae11b6552c127e9c2dd8aca9b77e22f11919f88409bde8eef53f", "ja": "それは……海美さんのお芝居見てれば、わかるよ。\n楽しんでるんだって。", "zh": "那个……看看海美小姐的表演，就能明白了。\n你是真的很享受其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_02_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "0b59e7bf44cc80f9e90fac05c879fdb2bbba863412701bf88d6cd5ee3d2752d6", "ja": "でも、それって、簡単なことじゃないし……。\nだから、一緒にお芝居してると……。", "zh": "可是，那也不是一件容易的事……  \n所以，和你一起演戏时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
